chitchat minimal. My favorite right now is the pumpkin immunity but usually I go for the chocolate gladiator with a banana and peanut butter. The also have some light snacks and a case with other healthy drinks. It will be interesting to see how they do with the new larger location across the street."},{"business_id":"Ct7vXSigXuH_sL54evNvug","review_id":"g9YBj-LmNl1uLd1dTaxQmg","date":"2018-03-07T21:19:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8815342783927917,"text_excerpt":"This has to be the nicest Smoothie King I've visited. The lobby is bordered by glass looking out onto busy Poydras Street and passing street cars on Saint Charles Avenue. The seating reminds me of our local Bistros. A long bar with high chairs sits in the middle with table on the outer walls. In a rush? No problem! There are several choices from the refrigerator: protein shakes, electrolyte drinks, water and pre-workout bottles. If you're looking for a spot to hang out and chat after a good jog/workout downtown with a friend? This is the spot! The friendly staff will accommodate."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
